// 用户协议保留中英双份全文（与 docs/user-agreement.zh-CN.md / user-agreement.en-US.md 同步维护；
// 内嵌是为了离线可看，且不依赖远程仓库地址）。其他语言回退英文版。
const agreementText = ref("")

const zhText = `CodingPlanQuota 用户使用协议

生效日期：2026-09-02 ｜ 维护方：MelotCOM Team

欢迎使用 CodingPlanQuota（以下简称"本应用"）。请在使用前仔细阅读并理解本协议。您下载、安装或使用本应用，即表示同意本协议的全部条款；若您不同意，请停止使用并卸载本应用。

一、服务说明
1.1 本应用是第三方移动端工具，用于查询您已订阅的 AI 编程套餐（Coding Plan / Agent Plan 等，以下称"套餐"）的额度使用情况（如 5 小时窗口、周、月额度及重置时间）。
1.2 本应用与智谱、Kimi、MiniMax、ZenMux、OpenCode、火山引擎等任何供应商均不存在关联、合作或代理关系。各供应商的名称与商标归其各自所有者所有，本应用不是任何供应商的官方产品。
1.3 本应用不提供 AI 内容生成服务，仅对套餐额度信息进行只读查询与展示。

二、账户与凭据
2.1 本应用不提供账号系统。使用时需您自行录入供应商签发的 API Key（部分供应商还要求组织 ID、项目 ID 等凭据）。
2.2 您的凭据仅保存在您的设备本地（应用沙盒内），仅用于向您选择的供应商发起只读额度查询请求。因您自行泄露凭据或设备失控造成的损失，由您自行承担。

三、数据与隐私
3.1 本应用无后端服务器，不收集、不存储于服务器、不上传您的个人信息、凭据或查询结果。
3.2 "上次查询结果"缓存仅保存在您的设备本地，用于离线查看最后状态。

四、供应商接口依赖与不可控风险（重点条款，请务必阅读）
4.1 本应用展示的额度数据来自各供应商的用量查询接口，其中多数为非官方文档化接口，其形态与可用性由供应商单方决定，不受本团队控制。
4.2 接口变更：如果供应商调整或更换其接口，团队将尝试及时调整本应用以恢复适配，但不承诺适配的及时性、完整性或持续性；适配期间相关供应商的查询可能不可用。
4.3 服务终止：如果供应商永久关闭相关服务或接口，团队将无法继续提供对该供应商的查询支持，对此不承担任何责任。
4.4 各供应商可能随时变更额度规则、接口形态或访问权限，本应用展示的数据可能出现延迟、缺失或错误。

五、数据准确性免责
5.1 额度数据由供应商接口返回，其准确性与完整性由供应商保证。本应用不对数据的准确性、及时性、完整性作任何明示或默示的担保。
5.2 您不应仅依据本应用展示的数据作出关键决策（如付费、变更或终止套餐）；相关决策请以供应商官方渠道的信息为准。

六、用户责任
6.1 您应遵守所使用供应商的服务条款及您所在地区的法律法规。
6.2 您不得利用本应用从事损害供应商或任何第三方合法权益的行为。

七、知识产权与开源许可
7.1 本应用以 BSD-3-Clause 许可证开源，代码见项目仓库。
7.2 本应用的名称、界面及文档版权归 MelotCOM Team 所有；各供应商名称与商标归其各自所有者所有。

八、免责声明与责任限制
8.1 本应用按"现状"与"现有"基础提供，不附带任何形式的担保。
8.2 在适用法律允许的最大范围内，团队对因使用或无法使用本应用而产生的任何直接、间接、偶然、特殊或惩罚性损失不承担责任。

九、协议变更
9.1 团队可能不时更新本协议，更新后将在应用内或项目仓库公示。您在协议更新后继续使用本应用，视为接受更新后的协议。

十、终止
10.1 您可随时停止使用并卸载本应用。若您违反本协议，团队有权终止您对本应用相关服务的使用。`

const enText = `CodingPlanQuota User Agreement

Effective Date: 2026-09-02 | Maintained by MelotCOM Team

Welcome to CodingPlanQuota (the "App"). Please read this Agreement carefully before use. By downloading, installing, or using the App, you agree to be bound by all terms of this Agreement. If you do not agree, please stop using and uninstall the App.

1. Description of the Service
1.1 The App is a third-party mobile tool used to check the quota usage of AI coding subscription plans you have subscribed to (Coding Plans / Agent Plans, the "Plans"), such as 5-hour rolling windows, weekly, and monthly quotas and their reset times.
1.2 The App is not affiliated with, partnered with, or an agent of any provider, including but not limited to Zhipu AI, Kimi, MiniMax, ZenMux, OpenCode, or Volcengine. Provider names and trademarks belong to their respective owners. The App is not an official product of any provider.
1.3 The App does not provide AI content generation; it only performs read-only quota queries and displays the results.

2. Accounts and Credentials
2.1 The App does not provide an account system. To use it, you must enter API keys issued by your providers (some providers also require an Organization ID, Project ID, or similar credentials).
2.2 Your credentials are stored only on your device (within the App sandbox) and are used solely to make read-only quota query requests to the providers you choose. You are solely responsible for any loss caused by disclosing your credentials or losing control of your device.

3. Data and Privacy
3.1 The App has no backend server. It does not collect, store on any server, or upload your personal information, credentials, or query results.
3.2 The "last query result" cache is stored only on your device for offline viewing of the latest status.

4. Provider Interface Dependency and Uncontrollable Risks (Key Section — Please Read Carefully)
4.1 The quota data displayed by the App comes from each provider's usage query interface, most of which are unofficial and undocumented interfaces. Their form and availability are determined unilaterally by the providers and are beyond the team's control.
4.2 Interface changes: If a provider modifies or replaces its interface, the team will attempt to adjust the App to restore compatibility in a timely manner, but does not promise the timeliness, completeness, or continuity of such adaptation. Queries for the affected provider may be unavailable during the adaptation period.
4.3 Service termination: If a provider permanently shuts down the relevant service or interface, the team will be unable to continue providing query support for that provider, and shall not be held liable for this.
4.4 Providers may change quota rules, interface formats, or access permissions at any time; the data displayed by the App may be delayed, missing, or incorrect.

5. Disclaimer on Data Accuracy
5.1 Quota data is returned by provider interfaces; its accuracy and completeness are guaranteed by the providers. The App makes no express or implied warranty regarding the accuracy, timeliness, or completeness of such data.
5.2 You should not make critical decisions (such as payments, plan changes, or cancellations) based solely on the data displayed by the App; please refer to the providers' official channels for such decisions.

6. User Responsibilities
6.1 You shall comply with the terms of service of the providers you use and with the laws and regulations of your jurisdiction.
6.2 You shall not use the App to harm the legitimate rights and interests of any provider or third party.

7. Intellectual Property and Open Source License
7.1 The App is open source under the BSD-3-Clause License; see the project repository for the source code.
7.2 The name, interface, and documentation of the App are copyrighted by MelotCOM Team. Provider names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.

8. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability
8.1 The App is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind.
8.2 To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the team shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or punitive damages arising from the use of or inability to use the App.

9. Changes to This Agreement
9.1 The team may update this Agreement from time to time. Updates will be published in the App or in the project repository. Your continued use of the App after an update constitutes acceptance of the updated Agreement.

10. Termination
10.1 You may stop using and uninstall the App at any time. If you breach this Agreement, the team reserves the right to terminate your use of the services related to the App.`

onShow(() => {
	uni.setNavigationBarTitle({ title : t("nav.agreement") })
